2. In this Order —
“Director” means the Director of the STI appointed by the IMF;
“IMF” means the International Monetary Fund;
“IMF professional staff” means —
(a)an officer or employee of the IMF assigned by the IMF to work in the STI and holding the appointment of Director, Senior Economist or Economist of the STI; or
(b)any other officer or employee of the IMF assigned by the IMF to work in the STI and mutually recognised by the Government and the IMF as a professional staff of the STI;
“STI” means the IMF‑Singapore Regional Training Institute located in Singapore.
